      "widgets_values": [
        "A woman with dark wavy hair and bangs stands in a richly decorated room, wearing an elaborate black velvet gown adorned with silver embroidery and lace.\n\nSubject: A fair-skinned woman with dark wavy hair styled with a black headband and a white decorative clip, featuring light eyes and a neutral expression.\n\nClothing: An ornate black velvet dress with intricate silver floral embroidery along the edges, sheer lace sleeves, and a deep neckline.\n\nAction: Her right hand is raised to her chest in a graceful gesture, while her left arm rests at her side; she gazes directly forward with a calm demeanor.\n\nEnvironment: A luxurious interior with polished wooden paneling, a large ornate gold-framed mirror reflecting candlelight, and a tapestry hanging on the wall behind her.\n\nCamera: Medium close-up shot with shallow depth of field, focusing sharply on the subject while softly blurring the background details.\n\nLighting: Warm ambient lighting from multiple candles in the background creates soft highlights on her face and jewelry, casting gentle shadows that enhance the texture of her clothing.\n\nObjects: A silver choker necklace with emerald green gemstones, matching drop earrings, a ringed hand with multiple rings including emeralds, a bracelet on each wrist, and a small white decorative hair clip.\n\nStyle Details: High-fidelity photography with cinematic color grading, rich textures in velvet and lace, elegant composition reminiscent of historical portraiture, and subtle film grain for depth.\n"
